      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      485.11,
      286.68,
      596.48
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: Two allotments of land in total Extent of about 0.0632 Hectare and depicted in Preliminary Plan No.: Maha/6423, Surveyed and Prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveyor of Kandy District, situated in Village of Madawala, in Minor Division of Medasiya-pathtuwa in Harispathtuwa Divisioal Secretariat Division in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
